  << /ActualText (Every business follows an approval workflow for financial transactions\056 A Maker creates the payment\054 a Checker reviews and verifies it\054 and an Approver gives the final authorization before it is processed\056 To support this standard financial workflow\054 Tawha Pay assigns these responsibilities to three dedicated user roles\072 Maker\054 Checker\054 and Approver\056)
